{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07900","headline":"同王九题就师山房 · 孟浩然","name":"同王九题就师山房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚憩支公室，故人逢右军。\n轩窗避炎暑，翰墨动新文。\n竹蔽檐前日，雨随堦下云。\n周游清荫徧，吟卧夕阳曛。\n江静櫂歌歇，溪深樵语闻。\n归途未忍去，携手恋清芬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}